{"3152740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "HeHe Remake", "steam_appid": 3152740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152740/extras/cd3e3ff2604d208e1aeb477135a49a26.avif?t=1767361300\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Once, the HeHe race mined deep beneath their world, unearthing precious metals to trade with the HuHu.<br>For generations, their skies promised peace and prosperity.<br>Until one night — <strong>a crimson moon rose.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Under its blood-red light, creatures began to rain from the heavens.<br>They were the <strong>spawn of ReRe</strong>, each born to silence the screams of the HeHe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Driven by terror, the HeHe fled into the deepest pits of their world.<br>But in the darkness, there was no safety — only hunger.<br>Their food ran out. Their hope faded.<br>And soon, only a handful of warriors remained, standing against the endless red tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">They were no longer miners.<br><strong>They were the last spark of survival.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our character gains various movement mechanics through the weapons they equip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The movement mechanics are physics-based.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As we explore the game world,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we engage in various parkour challenges,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sweat in boss battles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and obtain unique items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >while trying to save our friends from the red creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wherever you click with the mouse, you will move in the opposite direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you press the right mouse button, you will perform your special attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you gain new abilities, you will progress to different areas.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152740/extras/cd3e3ff2604d208e1aeb477135a49a26.avif?t=1767361300\" width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Story</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Once, the HeHe race mined deep beneath their world, unearthing precious metals to trade with the HuHu.<br>For generations, their skies promised peace and prosperity.<br>Until one night — <strong>a crimson moon rose.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Under its blood-red light, creatures began to rain from the heavens.<br>They were the <strong>spawn of ReRe</strong>, each born to silence the screams of the HeHe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Driven by terror, the HeHe fled into the deepest pits of their world.<br>But in the darkness, there was no safety — only hunger.<br>Their food ran out. Their hope faded.<br>And soon, only a handful of warriors remained, standing against the endless red tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">They were no longer miners.<br><strong>They were the last spark of survival.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our character gains various movement mechanics through the weapons they equip.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The movement mechanics are physics-based.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As we explore the game world,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >we engage in various parkour challenges,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >sweat in boss battles,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and obtain unique items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >while trying to save our friends from the red creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wherever you click with the mouse, you will move in the opposite direction.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you press the right mouse button, you will perform your special attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you gain new abilities, you will progress to different areas.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "When the crimson moon rose, the HeHe were forced to abandon the surface and descend into the depths. Now, hunted by ReRe’s spawn, survival is no longer about mining — it’s about defying extinction.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Bulgarian, Danish, Indonesian, Dutch, Finnish, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Spanish - Latin America, Polish, Hungarian, Norwegian, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Greek, Czech, Swedish, Afrikaans, Amharic, Albanian, Assamese, Azerbaijani, Bangla, Basque, Belarusian, Bosnian, Dari, Armenian, Estonian, Persian, Filipino, Welsh, Galician, Gujarati, Georgian, Hausa, Hindi, Croatian, Kannada, Catalan, Kazakh, Quechua, K'iche', Khmer, Konkani, Kyrgyz, Latvian, Lithuanian, Luxembourgish, Macedonian, Malayalam, Malay, Maltese, Maori, Marathi, Mongolian, Nepali, Odia, Punjabi (Gurmukhi), Punjabi (Shahmukhi), Kinyarwanda, Sinhala, Sindhi, Slovak, Slovenian, Sorani, Sotho, Swahili, Serbian, Tajik, Tamil, Tatar, Telugu, Tigrinya, Tswana, Turkmen, Urdu, Uyghur, Valencian, Wolof, Xhosa, Yoruba, Zulu, Cherokee, Uzbek, Hebrew, Igbo, Irish, Scots, Icelandic", "h